Package: evinf
Type: Package
Title: Inference with Extreme Value Inflated Count Data
Version: 0.10.0
Description: Allows users to model and draw inferences from extreme value inflated
    count data, and to evaluate these models and compare them to their non
    extreme-value inflated counterparts. The package is built to be compatible
    with standard model-presentation tools such as the 'broom', 'generics', and
    'modelsummary' packages.
